# Binary files a maintainer has looked at and approved for this public repository, by SHA-256.
# The name guard (scripts/name_guard.py) never inspects a binary: it publishes only these exact bytes.
# One digest per line, then a note. A pull request cannot approve its own binary: the guard reads
# this list from the default branch, so the approval is merged first, by a maintainer.
